e riparian forest is preserved, and the canopy covers almost the entire bed. The rivers where the specimens were sampled do not cross urban perimeters, and no signs of severe environmental degradation were detected. The type locality where the new species was caught, is a stream river with sand botton and gravel. Smaller individuals were collected from small roots of riparian vegetation and submerged trunks and branches, while the larger individuals, including the holotype, were always collected from submerged trunks and branches.","","text","",""]]},"SBKGR":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"SL9N3":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"STH7S":{"d":[["","TW","iso","native",""]]},"STZRF":{"d":[["Distribution: Scopaeus crassipunctatus was collected at the edge of Mount Halimun-Salak National Park in the provinces of Banten and Jawa Barat in western Java.","","text","",""]]},"SWC8T":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"SYDP9":{"d":[["Sichuan","","text","",""]]},"T3KQ6":{"d":[["Norway","NO","iso","",""]]},"TSX6D":{"d":[["Caribbean","","text","",""],["Middle America","","text","",""],["North America","","text","",""]]},"TY3NK":{"d":[["Denmark","DK","iso","",""]]},"TYQQJ":{"d":[["North America","","text","",""]]},"V3CY4":{"d":[["Distribution. Costa Rica.","","text","",""]]},"V3D84":{"d":[["Southern Asia","","text","",""]]},"V5PXF":{"d":[["Middle Asia","47485","mrgid","",""]]},"V5Q7F":{"d":[["Sweden","2180","mrgid","",""]]},"VBPQ":{"d":[["Bosnia-Herzegovina","48517","mrgid","",""],["Croatia","48518","mrgid","",""]]},"VCBK3":{"d":[["Idaho","","text","",""],["Washington","","text","",""]]},"WGD7":{"d":[["","ID","iso","",""],["","MY","iso","",""]]},"XSHF":{"d":[["New Caledonian Exclusive Economic Zone","8312","mrgid","",""],["New Zealand Exclusive Economic Zone","8455","mrgid","",""],["West Pacific","14290","mrgid","",""]]},"ZQFH":{"d":[["C-Madagascar","","text","",""]]}}